            { "@type": "Question", "name": "What if I retake a course? How does that affect my GPA?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "School policies on retaking courses vary. Some schools replace the old grade with the new grade in GPA calculation, while others average the two grades, or only count the credits once. Check your institution's academic policy." } },
